---
description: Dead-code detection. Always use Unreach MCP instead of guessing.
globs:
  - "**/*.py"
  - "**/*.ts"
  - "**/*.tsx"
alwaysApply: false
---

Do not guess unused or orphan code. Call MCP `unreach.scan`, then `unreach.workflow`, and follow its steps. Only `block` findings (confidence ≥ 0.85) are actionable without verification. Never delete files unless the user explicitly approves after the validate steps pass. Record each reviewed finding with `unreach.remember`.
